# Kogsy Operator Demo

- This is a **demo**: mock all outside systems (telephony, grocery, medical, payments).
- UI: **Google Material Design only** (`@mui/material`, `@mui/icons-material`). No other UI kits.
- Core demo paths: grocery (milk ending) and medical (foot pain → physio if allowed).
- Always surface AI thinking tree + tenant transcript on the operator view.
- Auto-order only after mock checks: `autoOrderEnabled`, price ≤ `maxAutoOrderPrice`, sufficient `walletBalance`.
- Operator can intervene and switch any live call AI → manual.
- Prefer extending `src/mocks/` and thinking-tree branches over adding real integrations.
- Deploy via Render Blueprint [`render.yaml`](../../render.yaml) (static site); do not add a Node web server for this demo.
